---
---

<style>
  header {
    position: relative;
    background-color: white;
    padding: 4rem 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    header {
      padding: 6rem 0;
    }
  }

  .hero-container {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .hero-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }

  .hero-copy {
    max-width: 44rem;
  }

  .hero-label {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(255, 111, 0, 0.12);
    color: #FF6F00;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    line-height: 1.05;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-gray-900);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 4rem;
    }
  }

  .hero-title span {
    color: #FF6F00;
  }

  .hero-text {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .hero-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .hero-buttons {
      flex-direction: row;
    }
  }

  .hero-buttons .btn-primary {
    background: #FF6F00;
    border-color: transparent;
  }

  .hero-buttons .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #FF8F00;
  }

  .hero-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-stat {
    background: var(--color-gray-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-gray-100);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-stat strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    color: #FF6F00;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .hero-stat span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .hero-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .hero-visual::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -1rem;
    right: 2rem;
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 111, 0, 0.12);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .phone-mockup {
    position: relative;
    width: min(340px, 100%);
    aspect-ratio: 0.52;
    background: #111827;
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 18px;
    box-shadow: 0 35px 80px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.15);
    overflow: hidden;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .phone-screen {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 36px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .phone-notch {
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 110px;
    height: 24px;
    background: #111827;
    border-radius: 0 0 20px 20px;
  }

  .phone-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px 18px 0;
  }

  .phone-greeting {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-gray-500);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .phone-name {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-gray-900);
  }

  .phone-avatar {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: #FF6F00;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: white;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .phone-location {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0 18px;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-gray-700);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .phone-card {
    margin: 1.5rem 18px 0;
    padding: 1rem 1rem 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,111,0,0.95), rgba(204,79,0,0.95));
    border-radius: 28px;
    color: white;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
  }

  .phone-card-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .phone-card-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .phone-card-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: white;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .phone-footer {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    padding: 1rem 18px 20px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
  }

  .phone-footer span {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
  }

  .phone-footer strong {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-gray-900);
  }
</style>

<header>
  <div class="hero-container">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="hero-label">Usługi klimatyzacyjne</span>
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Komfortowa temperatura w Twoim domu <span>przez cały rok.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-text">
        Zajmujemy się profesjonalnym doborem, montażem i serwisem klimatyzacji. Postaw na sprawdzone rozwiązania i ciesz się chłodnym, świeżym powietrzem w każdym pomieszczeniu.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-buttons">
        <a href="#wybor" class="btn btn-primary">Wybierz klimatyzator</a>
        <a href="tel:+48123456789" class="btn btn-outline">Zadzwoń: +48 123 456 789</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="hero-stat">
          <strong>24/7</strong>
          <span>Dyżur serwisowy</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stat">
          <strong>15 lat</strong>
          <span>Doświadczenia</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stat">
          <strong>5 000+</strong>
          <span>Zadowolonych klientów</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="phone-mockup">
        <div class="phone-screen">
          <div class="phone-notch"></div>
          <div class="phone-header">
            <div>
              <div class="phone-greeting">Aktualizacja</div>
              <div class="phone-name">i Hydraulik</div>
            </div>
            <div class="phone-avatar">iH</div>
          </div>
          <div class="phone-location">
            <span>Warszawa</span>
          </div>
          <div class="phone-card">
            <div class="phone-card-title">Zgłoszenie awarii</div>
            <div class="phone-card-text">Technik w drodze. Odbierz telefon, aby potwierdzić miejsce interwencji.</div>
            <a href="tel:+48123456789" class="phone-card-btn">Zadzwoń teraz</a>
          </div>
          <div class="phone-footer">
            <span>Stan usługi</span>
            <strong>Oczekiwanie na potwierdzenie</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>